# Monorepo recipe: this is the single pkgbase for every gstreamer monorepo
# split output, so the monorepo is cloned, configured and built exactly once.
# It replaces the former per-output recipes packages/stable/{gstreamer,
# gst-plugins-base, gst-plugins-base-libs, gst-plugins-bad,
# gst-plugins-bad-libs, gst-plugins-good, gst-editing-services, gst-libav}.

